## Control {{controlId}}: Control Information Posted on Publicly Accessible Systems

**Implementation Status:** {{status}}

This organization controls information posted or processed on publicly accessible information systems within the {{tenantName}} M365 GCC High tenant. Controls prevent unauthorized disclosure of CUI through public-facing services by restricting external sharing capabilities, anonymous access, and public link generation across all M365 services.

{{#if sharepointConfigured}}
SharePoint Online external sharing is restricted to "{{sharepointSharingCapability}}" mode, preventing anonymous or unauthenticated access to CUI resources. Content shared externally requires authentication through approved identity providers. Azure AD cross-tenant policies prevent creation of public-facing links to CUI-classified content. Information designated as CUI is prohibited from publication on any publicly accessible system without explicit authorization from {{variables.accessControlAdministrator}}.
{{else}}
SharePoint Online external sharing restrictions have not been configured. Public information controls are not enforced beyond default M365 settings, pending configuration.
{{/if}}

{{#if policies}}
Conditional Access policies enforce additional public access restrictions:
{{#each policies}}
- **{{displayName}}** ({{state}}): Blocks {{#each grantControls.builtInControls}}{{this}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}} for public access scenarios.
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

{{#if infraResources}}
Supporting infrastructure:
{{#each infraResources}}
- {{resourceType}} "{{name}}"{{#if properties.retention_days}} (retention: {{properties.retention_days}} days){{/if}}
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

**Responsible Party:** {{variables.accessControlAdministrator}}

**Verification Method:** Review SharePoint external sharing settings, cross-tenant access policies, and content classification labels to verify public information controls.

